{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling journey on Thear planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Ben Echo and Anna Echo on their quest to explore the world and search for the source of their Stearone power while thwarting the plans of the dictator Keineus Erebus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/dd59efe57696bd83116389d0b4bf1733.poster.avif?t=1764000739\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/dd59efe57696bd83116389d0b4bf1733.webm?t=1764000739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/dd59efe57696bd83116389d0b4bf1733.mp4?t=1764000739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SET ON THE BEAUTIFUL AND VIBRANT PLANET THEAR</strong>, one of the planets discovered several thousand years ago. The lands here are blessed with powers derived from ancient artifacts known as Stearone. Filled to the brim with forests, mountains, deserts, seas, dungeons, and mysterious caves, the world is waiting for the player to explore. Using 2.5D graphics, Thear Planet is presented to you in full color and depth.   <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THEAR IS FULL OF POSSIBILITIES</strong> - Day/Night system ensures that encounters, events, and quests vary throughout the in-game day, Mysterious islands, which are only accessible by specialized ships, remain uncharted and full of mysteries, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/7be6e293133c7e82aa026414bb149410.poster.avif?t=1764000739\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/7be6e293133c7e82aa026414bb149410.webm?t=1764000739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/7be6e293133c7e82aa026414bb149410.mp4?t=1764000739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR ADVENTURER</strong> - Ben and Anna both possess a wide variety of unique abilities, skills, and weapons. Pick your favorite playstyle or try something else; it's all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JRPG CORE FEATURES</strong> - Weapon upgrades and evolution, skill tree expansion, weakness break, and ability burst, all of which a JRPG should have. Combine with unique mechanisms such as robot control and monster DNA transformation to give yourself an edge in combat and exploration while keeping the game fresh yet familiar.<br>The combat system involves avoiding, parrying, counterattacking, and staggering targets. Tinker with the expansive skill system to devastate enemies and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/223fef5b340cf55b82363add8152f3c2.poster.avif?t=1764000739\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/223fef5b340cf55b82363add8152f3c2.webm?t=1764000739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/223fef5b340cf55b82363add8152f3c2.mp4?t=1764000739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AND OTHER INTERESTING THINGS</strong> -<br>Inventor, a system in which the player collects ideas by taking photos to craft specific items. Keep exploring Thear for even more ideas. <br>Minigames such as monster chess, monster taming, fish catching, fish racing, and fish farming are included in Thear as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/6f1d4ab2e3d99548342411723bdfe1c1.poster.avif?t=1764000739\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/6f1d4ab2e3d99548342411723bdfe1c1.webm?t=1764000739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/extras/6f1d4ab2e3d99548342411723bdfe1c1.mp4?t=1764000739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting journey awaits you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2993820?t=1764000739","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/10ebeef6ea0605eb210867b3c918d5c4c9e860d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764000739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/c11b904762aa2df8a1e232cf384212726cafd969/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764000739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993820/c11b904762aa2df8a1e232cf384212726cafd969/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764000739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full contr